# Accepted Trivy findings (reviewed 2026-11-17, Trivy 0.76.2, image built from condaforge/miniforge3:25.11.0-1)
#
# All five come from the base image layer, not from TamiPami's own layers. The packages
# installed for the application are already at fixed versions (urllib3 2.8.0,
# setuptools 84.2.1, msgpack 1.2.4). The flagged copies are vendored inside pip/conda tooling,
# which is used only at build time. The runtime container runs `streamlit` as a non-root user
# and does not run pip or conda.
#
# Re-review when the base image or pip is updated; remove entries that no longer appear.

# msgpack 1.1.2 vendored in pip (pip/_vendor/vendor.txt)
